<Project>

  <!--
    Lodestar.Stats.Regression owns its version here, independently of the other
    packages (see docs/decisions/0001-the-foundations-target-frameworks-comparison-unit-persistence-and-versioning.md).

    0.1.0 shipped on 2026-09-10, this package's first release. It carries two
    inter-package edges, to Lodestar.Stats for the Student and Fisher tails and
    to Lodestar.Decomposition for the Householder QR; both floors live in
    src/Directory.Packages.props and are deliberately decoupled from this number.

    0.2.0 is minor rather than a patch, and it now carries two lots because
    neither has shipped: GeneralizedLinearModel, GlmFamily, GlmOptions and
    GlmSummary (decision 0003), and CovarianceType with the two properties that
    select and echo it (decision 0004). Both are new public surface and nothing
    existing moved or was removed. No new inter-package edge came with either:
    the IRLS loop and the robust covariance reuse the same internal
    least-squares core the OLS half already had.

    It stays declared ahead of its tag, the one package that does, because
    Lodestar.Stats.TimeSeries depends on this 0.2.0 and must not ship first
    (CONTRIBUTING.md, Working across two packages).
  -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <LodestarStatsRegressionVersion>0.2.1</LodestarStatsRegressionVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
